blocks.explanation:
Dono islets of Langerhans mein bante hain: insulin tadad mein zyada beta (β) cells, glucagon alpha (α) cells banate hain.

Insulin (blood glucose barhne par) glucose kam karta hai:
1. body cells (maslan skeletal muscles aur fat cells) mein glucose ka dakhla tez kar ke;
2. liver mein glycogenesis (glucose se glycogen) barha kar;
3. cellular respiration mein glucose ka istemal barha kar;
4. zaid glucose ko fat bana kar;
5. gluconeogenesis (glucose banna) rok kar.

Glucagon (glucose normal se kam hone par) zyada tar liver ke jama glycogen ko tor kar glucose barhata hai; glucose khoon mein aata aur cells energy ke liye lete hain.

Adrenal medulla adrenal gland (har gurde ke oopar aik) ka andar wala hissa hai. Yeh epinephrine (adrenaline) aur norepinephrine (noradrenaline) banata hai.

Fight or flight: pareshani mein medulla yeh hormones kharij karta hai jo jism ko tayyar karte hain:
1. dil ki tez dharkan;
2. BP zyada;
3. bronchioles ka phailna;
4. blood glucose barhna;
5. jild aur hazm ke organs ko khoon kam.

Control: medulla ka ikhraj nervous system ke control mein hai (cortex anterior pituitary ke hormones ke).
Bigar: zyadti se rozmarra mein hypertension aur jarhana rawayya; kami se emergency ka muqabla nahi ho pata.
